  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that, for vectors&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>)</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.